    "answer": {
      "short": "$5\\times4\\times7=140$",
      "worked": "There are 5 choices of T-shirt, 4 choices of pants and 7 choices of shoes. By the multiplication principle,\n$$N=5\\times4\\times7=140.$$\nThere are 140 outfits.",
